    <div>

      <p begin="00:04.380" end="00:12.380" ttm:agent="v1">Really, I'm honestly just sad about my shoes</p>

      <p begin="00:12.840" end="00:19.160" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I like to dance when I party</p>

      <p begin="00:19.160" end="00:21.130" ttm:agent="v1">I like to kiss everybody</p>

      <p begin="00:21.130" end="00:22.760" ttm:agent="v1">Where the heck is Saki?</p>

      <p begin="00:22.760" end="00:24.720" ttm:agent="v1">She's waiting down in the lobby</p>

      <p begin="00:24.720" end="00:29.840" ttm:agent="v1">I'm tryna break it down, yeah, baby, get her, turn up the party</p>

      <p begin="00:29.840" end="00:33.160" ttm:agent="v1">I like to dance when I party</p>

      <p begin="00:33.160" end="00:35.210" ttm:agent="v1">I like to kiss everybody</p>

