      <p begin="00:38.730" end="00:43.160" ttm:agent="v1">I'm tryna break it down, yeah, baby, get her, turn up the party</p>

      <p begin="00:43.160" end="00:46.920" ttm:agent="v1">Run it back, yeah, I like this track (yeah), drop it, drop a bag</p>

      <p begin="00:46.920" end="00:50.730" ttm:agent="v1">Louis V bag round my neck, oh, yeah, 'cause I'm so classy</p>

      <p begin="00:50.730" end="00:53.800" ttm:agent="v1">I still break it down though, I bet you can't get past me</p>

      <p begin="00:53.800" end="00:57.400" ttm:agent="v1">Hot babe, sweet angel, I'm so cute, I'm so nerdy, so sassy</p>

      <p begin="00:57.400" end="01:00.880" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, shit, oh, my god, DJ, play my favorite song</p>

      <p begin="01:00.880" end="01:04.970" ttm:agent="v1">Raise the roof, let the dogs out, play something by Beyonce</p>

      <p begin="01:04.970" end="01:08.240" ttm:agent="v1">I'm not tryna leave until they kick us to the road</p>

      <p begin="01:08.240" end="01:12.170" ttm:agent="v1">But if they do, it's cool though, got an address in my phone</p>

